WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,840
Sister Zhihan, let me tell you, we have enough people trapped now.

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,440
Just stop dragging people in.

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:09,040
Jingjing, we are lucky to be able to survive being trapped in the mall.

4
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,880
I don’t know how many people are starving and suffering outside.

5
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:14,560
We are all survivors, and we must not ignore death and save ourselves.

6
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:21,300
He's still working as a national security officer.

7
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,300
This vigilance is too poor, right?

8
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,250
It's okay if someone takes the gun away in front of you

9
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:29,190
But this little girl does have some skills.

10
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:30,830
Looks like a criminal

11
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:34,120
what are you doing

12
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,910
This is not a toy

13
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:40,660
Give me your gun back quickly

14
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,820
Sister Zhihan, do you think what my boyfriend taught me is right?

15
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:45,300
Will you die just by picking this thing?

16
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,340
Quietly, do you know what you are doing?

17
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:50,100
You are attacking a national security officer. Do you know that you will go to jail?

18
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,380
Give me the gun back now

19
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,180
I can decide not to pursue this matter
